:(  I suggest we invent lujvo by thinking again from the beginning.  I
don't believe that tanru are correct-- Signed, Lujvo Luver, lol.
Seriously, though, a tanru doesn't fit.  An exact meaning.  We want
there to be no confusion.  Clearly, quite clearly, this is a situation
prone towards confusion.  Very easily understood lujvo are needed, in
my opinion.  I like the specific day number lujvo.  Tomorrow.  Day
after tomorrow.  Day after the day after tomorrow.  Maybe that's not
the right shape.  But you probably get my idea.

